QuestGuidance.Register("en",215,{
[6849]="70037DBB\n1\tTalk to Gléowine outside Meduseld\tGléowine is outside Meduseld, worrying.\n2\tTalk to Horn outside Meduseld\tHorn is outside Meduseld, waiting to speak with you.\n3\tTalk to Aragorn outside Meduseld\tAragorn is outside Meduseld, waiting to speak with you.\n4\tTalk to Gandalf outside Meduseld\tGandalf is outside Meduseld, speaking words of wisdom to Théoden.\n5\tStand with Théoden and hear the commands of the king\tThéoden stands atop the steps outside Meduseld, gazing out upon his lands.\n6\tTalk to Gríma outside Meduseld\tGríma has been brought out of Meduseld and awaits the King's judgement.\n7\tStand with Théoden and hear the commands of the king\tThéoden stands atop the steps outside Meduseld, gazing out upon his lands.\n8\tTalk to Gríma outside Meduseld\030Talk to Éomer outside Meduseld\tGríma has asked to be named steward of Meduseld in Théoden's absence.\n9\tTalk to Gandalf outside Meduseld\tGríma has asked to be named steward of Meduseld in Théoden's absence.\n10\tStand with Théoden and hear the commands of the king\tThéoden stands atop the steps outside Meduseld, gazing out upon his lands.\n",
[6850]="700660DE\n1\tTalk to Dervorin\tTalk to Dervorin before the negotiation begins.\n2\tApproach Dravron\tApproach Dravron.\n3\tListen to Dervorin and Dravron\tListen to Dervorin and Dravron's conversation.\n4\tRegroup with Dervorin and the workers\tDefeat Dravron and his brigands.\n5\tTalk to Dervorin\tThe fight is over. Regroup with the others.\n",
[6851]="7002BFA7\n1\tTalk to Aculf\tYou should speak with Aculf.\n2\tDefeat all treasure-hunters\tYou must drive all of the brigands from Atburg.\n3\tTalk to Aculf\tSpeak with Aculf about your victory.\n",
[6852]="70072134\n1\tTalk to Razâl\tYou have arrived inside the servant's living quarters of the palace. You should talk to Razâl.\n2\tInvestigate the servants' quarters\tYou have arrived inside the servant's living quarters of the palace. You should investigate the area.\n3\tTalk to Razâl\tThothril the Entangler has begun to take over the minds of the servants in the palace. You should talk to Razâl.\n4\tDefeat maddening illusions (total: 10)\tThothril the Entangler has begun to take over the minds of the servants in the palace. You should defeat the maddening illusions to save those whose minds are still intact.\n5\tTalk to Razâl\tYou have defeated Thothril's illusions and saved who you can. You should talk to Razâl.\n6\tDefeat Head Servant Sintáhi\tAll that is left to do is to defeat the head servant before she can convert others to Thothril's cause. You should defeat Head Servant Sintáhi.\n",
[6853]="7005B517\n1\tTalk to Rúni\tLore-master Rúni waits for you by the falls in western Clovengap. You should talk to Rúni.\n2\tFind the crystal cave\tThe waterfall is in eastern Clovengap. Rúni the Lore-master believes there is a hidden cave behind the nearby waterfall. You should find the cave.\n3\tDefeat Bruidalg the Bloodletter\tThe source of the corruption is deep in the Min Návaid cave in Clovengap. You should uncover the source of the corrupted sarrowstones and put an end for good to the terrible experiments of Bruidalg the Bloodletter.\n4\tFind the secret tunnel\tThe secret tunnel is within the crystal cave, Min Návaid. The journal spoke of a secret tunnel whose entrance can be revealed by the light of the candle. With the Angmarim High Priest defeated, you should look for the secret tunnel.\n5\tSummon Praushod the Foetid\tPraushod the Foetid lies deeper within Min Návaid. You should summon Praushod the Foetid by striking the corrupted crystals.\n6\tInvestigate the dragon bones\tThe dragon bones are in Min Návaid. Lore-master Rúni has asked you to investigate the cave for dragon bones.\n7\tTalk to Rúni\tLore-master Rúni is in the crystal cave. You should tell Lore-master Rúni that the deed is done.\n",
[6854]="7005A7FE\n1\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Amdân. You should talk to Dáin.\n2\tFollow Dáin and join the gathering at Amdân\tDáin can be found at Amdân. You should accompany Dáin and join the gathering at Amdân.\n3\tListen as Thrain addresses the Kings of the Seven Houses at Amdân\tThrain is addressing the Kings of the Seven Houses at Amdân.\n4\tCheer for Thráin\tThráin can be found at Amdân. You should cheer for Thráin.\n5\tListen as Thrain addresses the Kings of the Seven Houses at Amdân\tThrain is addressing the Kings of the Seven Houses at Amdân.\n6\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Amdân. After listening to Thráin's council with the Kings of the Seven Houses, Dáin has beckoned you. You should talk to Dáin.\n",
[6855]="70022B4E\n1\tLocate and use first lever\030Locate and use second lever\030Locate and use third lever\tLevers that control the locking mechanism to the gate of the summoning chamber can be found in several large antechambers scattered within the barrow.\n2\tEnter the chamber to disrupt the ritual\tIn the furthest chamber of the ancient barrow, behind the now-open steel gate, resides the ritual chamber. Enter the chamber and disrupt the dark ritual that is taking place.\n3\tDefeat Iargandir\tDefeat the ritualist performing the ceremony on the fallen corpse.\n",
[6856]="700169DE\n1\tFollow Narmeleth\tNarmeleth has asked you to come with her, as she has someone very special for you to meet. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tFollow Narmeleth\tNarmeleth has asked you to come with her, as she has someone very special for you to meet. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tFollow Narmeleth\tNarmeleth has asked you to come with her, as she has someone very special for you to meet.\n",
[6857]="70052E2E\n1\tTalk to Baradal\tBaradal needs to talk to you. You should talk to Baradal.\n2\tDefeat Ránulur\tRánulur has come to finish what he started. You should defeat Ránulur!\n3\tListen to the conversation\tGaladriel and Arwen are conversing. You should listen to the conversation.\n4\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond would like to speak with you about what has transpired. You should talk to Elrond.\n",
[6858]="70035901\n1\tTalk to Barallas\tBarallas is standing at the Enting Hollow in eastern Balewood. Barallas has chosen to tell you of times long past in Fangorn Forest, when the Ents still stood united.\n2\tListen to Barallas' tale at Enting Hollow\tBarallas is recounting his tale of the Ents at the Enting Hollow in the Balewood. Barallas and the other Ents of the Balewood once stood united at the Enting Hollow before Núrzum came to Fangorn.\n3\tTalk to Barallas\tBarallas is standing at the Enting Hollow in the Balewood. Barallas has finished his tale of the Ents. You should speak with him before setting off.\n",
[6859]="700451B6\n1\tTalk to Guthláf on the field of battle\tGuthláf is on the fields of the Pelennor, ready to ride as his king commands.\n2\tRide with Guthláf and stand with the king\tThe battle rages before the White City.\n3\tGuard Théoden during his last moments\tDeath has come to the Pelennor, and even kings cannot stand against it forever.\n4\tGuard Théoden during his last moments\tDeath has come to the Pelennor, and even kings cannot stand against it forever.\n5\tTalk to Théoden\tThéoden has come to the end of his road, but he has a final request of you.\n6\tPick up the fallen banner where it fell from Guthláf's hand\tThéoden requested that you pick up the banner of Rohan where it fell, and give it to Éomer.\n7\tGive the banner to Éomer, as Théoden requested\tThéoden has asked you to give the banner to Éomer.\n8\tRemain on guard\tRemain on guard as Éomer remembers the fallen.\n",
[6860]="7001D0C9\n1\tTalk to Vatnar\tSpeak with Vatnar and begin your counterattack against the goblin-sappers!\n2\tTalk to Vatnar to return to the surface.\t\n",
[6861]="7004D6EC\n1\tTalk to Langhár\tYou have arrived at the edge of a section of deep woods. You should talk to Langhár.\n2\tFind Sterkist\tSterkist is somewhere within these woods. You should follow Langhár and find Sterkist. Langhár must survive!\n3\tDefeat Borzagor the Grisly\tSterkist is under attack! You should defeat Borzagor the Grisly!\n4\tTalk to Thorlind\tWith Sterkist recovered, it is time to escape. You should talk to Thorlind.\n",
[6862]="70047B5B\n1\tTalk to Merry\tMerry has brought your expedition to a stop. You should hear what he has to say.\n2\tBegin searching\tYou should begin searching the area for signs of the three half-orcs.\n3\tContinue searching\tYou should continue searching the area for signs of the three half-orcs.\n4\tStop to get your bearings\tYou should continue searching the area for signs of the three half-orcs.\n5\tContinue searching\tYou should resume searching the area for signs of the three half-orcs.\n6\tContinue searching\tYou should resume searching the area for signs of the three half-orcs.\n7\tTalk to Pippin\tYou should talk to Pippin and find out what he thinks he has seen.\n8\tYou should follow the footprints that Pippin discovered and see where they lead.\t\n9\tConfront the half-orcs\tYou have found the three half-orcs again. Join Merry and Pippin and try to get some answers out of them.\n10\tDefeat the enraged troll\tAn enraged troll has stumbled into the confrontation, knocking down one of the half-orcs and sending the other two fleeing. You must defend yourself against the troll!\n11\tTalk to the dying half-orc\tThe half-orc who was struck by the troll has some life yet in him. You should speak to him now and see what you can learn.\n12\tTalk to Merry\030Talk to Pippin\tYou should talk to Pippin and Merry.\n",
[6863]="70052D8D\n1\tTalk to Anórohir\tTalk to Anórohir.\n2\tProtect the Carrock and defeat the attacking drakes\tProtect the Carrock and defeat the attacking drakes.\n3\tDefeat Ormoth, the drake assault leader.\t\n4\tFind Varthmath\tFind Varthmath.\n",
[6864]="700355DD\n1\tSpeak with Thrymm\tThe White Hand have already penetrated the perimeter of Scylfig and are attacking. Speak with Thrymm to find out the plan to defend Scylfig.\n2\tFollow Thrymm to the northern stables\tFollow Thrymm to the northern stables to fend off the White Hand attackers.\n3\tFend off the White Hand attackers at the northern stables (total: 3)\tFend off the White Hand attackers near the northern stables.\n4\tSpeak with Thrymm at the northern stables\tThe northern stables have been secured. Speak with Thrymm to find out where to head next.\n5\tFollow Thrymm to the centre of town\tFollow Thrymm to the centre of Scylfig to defend against the White Hand attackers.\n6\tSpeak with Grimgar in the centre of Scylfig\tGárwig's grandson, Grimgar, has been holding his own along with his brother, Humbald in the centre of town. Speak with him.\n7\tAssist Thrymm in defeating any remaining Orcs in the centre of Scylfig\tA giant has breached the gate to Scylfig and is charging forth into the centre of town.\n8\tSpeak with Thrymm in the centre of Scylfig\tThe southern stables have been secured, but the giant Núrzum has breached the gate. Speak with Thrymm to find out what to do next.\n9\tFollow Thrymm to the Mead Hall\tFollow Thrymm up towards the Mead Hall to make sure nothing gets past.\n10\tFend off the White Hand attackers along the path up to the Mead Hall (total: 3)\tHelp Thrymm fend off the White Hand attackers along the path leading to the Mead Hall.\n11\tSpeak with Thrymm on the road leading up to the Mead Hall\tGrimgar and Humbald met an unfortunate fate while dealing with Núrzum. Speak with Thrymm to find out the next course of action.\n12\tStand beside Thrymm and guard the Mead Hall\tGarsig and Cynegar are now trying to head Núrzum off at the road before he gets to the Mead Hall.\n13\tGo to the Mead Hall and stand guard\tThe giant, Núrzum has breached the gate and is now heading towards the Mead Hall. It needs to be defended at all costs.\n14\tSpeak with Thrymm in front of the Mead Hall\tCynegar and Garsig were the latest to perish at the hands of Núrzum.\n15\tStand with Cyneberg and observe the battle between Thrymm and Núrzum\tThe giant, Núrzum charges forth towards the Mead Hall and is met there by Thrymm Red-beard. Observe the battle between the two warriors and ensure that no one gets into the Mead Hall.\n16\tSpeak with Cyneberg\tAfter defeating Thrymm, Núrzum turns and departs Scylfig. The women and children inside the Mead Hall appear to be safe.\n",
[6865]="7002FECC\n1\tTalk to Ides\tIdes can be found at the mill, north of the training grounds. Ides wishes to discuss her thoughts with you.\n2\tTalk to Ides\tIdes can be found at the mill, north of the training grounds. Ides seems to have heard a noise and wishes to inquire about it.\n3\tTalk to Ides about Edwulf\tIdes can be found at the forked path along the road, west of the training grounds. Ides has found Edwulf, injured in battle, and would like to discuss what should be done.\n4\tDefeat the Uruk-hai at the training grounds (total: 9)\tUruks have assaulted the Rohirrim training grounds. Ides has asked you to help deal with the attacking Uruk-hai.\n5\tReturn to Ides along the road\tIdes can be found along the road, west of the training grounds. After defeating the Uruk-hai invaders, Ides awaits your return.\n6\tDefeat the Uruk-hai warrior\tIdes can be found along the road, west of the training grounds. Ides has spotted an Uruk, and will need your help to defeat it. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n7\tTalk to Ides along the roadway\tIdes can be found along the road, west of the training grounds. After defeating the Uruk-hai invaders, Ides awaits your return.\n",
[6866]="70069041\n1\tRescue the miners trapped by the collapsed shafts throughout the mine. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n2\tEscape the mine before it collapses!\tYour rescued the miners, but the mine is shaking violently. Make your way out of the mine.\n",
[6867]="7002D72A\n1\tApproach and listen to Shadowfax and his companion\tShadowfax is waiting for you here in the fields of Rohan. Shadowfax has led his companion here to wait for you, though the companion is not yet aware of why he came to this place.\n2\tApproach and listen to Shadowfax and his companion\tShadowfax awaits you on the border of the eastern fields of Rohan.\n",
[6868]="70043159\n1\tTalk to Spalvi within the snow-storm\tYou have climbed up into the mountains with Spalvi in search of cave entrances.\n2\tSpalvi has asked you to brave the snowstorm and look or look around for cave entrances.\t\n3\tTalk to Spalvi within the snow-storm\tSpalvi is high up the Redhorn Pass, in the middle of a frightening snow-storm.\n4\tSurvive the confrontation with the Dourhand raiding party\tYou and Spalvi have climbed high up the Redhorn Pass in search of some way of reaching Bingo, but now a new danger has revealed itself: a raiding party of Dourhands!\n5\tTalk to Spalvi within the snow-storm\tThóvarg is not willing to stand down, and Spalvi is itching for a fight.\n6\tTalk to Spalvi within the snow-storm\tYou and Spalvi have survived the attack of a Dourhand raiding party.\n",
[6869]="70032012\n1\tInvestigate the old manor to ensure that the refugees may move in\tThe old home of Frithbald, father to Frithbéorth, is located in the north-east corner of Harwick. You should investigate the house before the refugees begin to move in.\n2\tDefeat rats in the refugees' new home (total: 8)\tFrithbéorth neglected to mention the rat infestation in the manor that he just sold to Cíllan for a hefty sum. You should defeat the rats that reside in the manor.\n3\tReturn to Cíllan at the door of her new manor\tCíllan just arrived in the new manor you just purchased for her in Harwick. You should hasten to Cíllan to hand her the keys and tell her of the deal with Frithbéorth...and it would be wise to mention the rats as well.\n",
[6870]="7001C66F\n1\tTalk to Ningloril\tNingloril is in the antechamber to the dungeons of Dol Guldur. The Elves have stormed the dungeons, and Ningloril is waiting to speak to you in the main antechamber.\n2\tFind Bori and talk to him\tBori is being held somewhere in the East Wing of the dungeons. Find Bori in the East Wing of the dungeons and free him.\n3\tTalk to Bori\tBori is in a cell in the East Wing of the dungeons of Dol Guldur. Bori is waiting for you to leave barrels of nightshade in the hallway to knock out any guards that arrive, then to escort him out of the dungeon. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tTalk to Ningloril\tNingloril has run into trouble in the antechamber of the dungeons. Talk to Ningloril when she has been freed from the cell.\n",
[6871]="7005990B\n1\tTalk to Lothrandir\tYou have arrived at the shipwreck of the Thoroval. You should talk to Lothrandir.\n2\tListen to the conversation\tLothrandir is speaking with Arvedui at the shipwreck of the Thoroval. You should listen to the conversation.\n3\tDefeat the Angmarim\tThe Angmarim have launched an ambush! You should defeat the Angmarim attackers!\n4\tListen to the conversation\tLothrandir is speaking with Arvedui at the shipwreck of the Thoroval. You should listen to the conversation.\n",
[6872]="7002EFE3\n1\tTalk to Burnoth\tTalk to Burnoth.\n2\tHear Burnoth's tale\tHear Burnoth's tale.\n3\tTalk to Burnoth\tTalk to Burnoth.\n4\tTalk to Ulf the Reaver\tTalk to Ulf the Reaver in the southern end of Eaworth.\n5\tHear Ulf's tale\tHear Ulf's tale.\n6\tTalk to Ulf the Reaver\tSpeak with Ulf the Reaver.\n7\tTalk to Léofdag\tSpeak with Léofdag near the southern gate of Eaworth.\n8\tHear Léofdag's tale\tHear Léofdag's tale.\n9\tTalk to Léofdag\tSpeak with Léofdag.\n10\tDefend Eaworth and spring the trap\tDefend Eaworth and spring the trap.\n11\tTalk to Reeve Ingbert\tReeve Ingbert is outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth. You should speak with Reeve Ingbert.\n",
[6873]="700253DD\n1\tTalk to Radanir\tRadanir stands within the Forsaken Road, wishing to speak with you about the grim place.\n2\tTalk to Maonir\tYou have not ventured far along the Forsaken Road and have already encountered one of the Oath-breakers cursed by Isildur.\n3\tTalk to Halbarad\tHalbarad has confronted Maonir along the Forsaken Road.\n4\tTalk to Maonir\tMaonir has given in, at last, and seems to wish to speak with you.\n5\tFind and talk to Britou\tMaonir told you that Britou wants to speak with you, and that you could find him by keeping the chasm on your right.\n6\tTalk to Candaith\tCandaith is in the depths of the Forsaken Road, confronting the Oath-breaker Britou.\n7\tRun back through the Forsaken Road and talk to Radanir to escape!\tYou have been betrayed. You must escape from the Forsaken Road.\n",
[6874]="7000D6F9\n1\tDefeat Prakhum\tYou must defeat Prakhum, the emissary of Goblin-town, in order to retrieve some of Golodir's equipment.\n",
[6875]="7000D6F8\n1\tDefeat Laugi Goldentongue\tYou must defeat Laugi Goldentongue, the emissary of the Dourhands from the Blue Mountains, in order to retrieve some of Golodir's equipment.\n",
[6876]="7000D6FA\n1\tDefeat Karstíona\tYou must defeat Karstíona, the emissary of the Trév Duvárdain from western Angmar, in order to retrieve some of Golodir's equipment.\n",
[6877]="7000D6FB\n1\tDefeat Bâlak\tYou must defeat Bâlak.\n",
[6878]="70027914\n1\tTalk to Blaire\tSpeak with Blaire before continuing.\n2\tEnter Knotfist's hut\tEnter Knotfist's hut.\n3\tThe time to end the nightmare of the Abominations has come. Finish what has been started.\t\n",
[6879]="70043B4C\n1\tTalk to Sabert within the entrance of Stangard\tSabert is at the entrance of Stangard, ready to prepare for the Easterling attack.\n2\tTalk to Bingo and learn what tasks he will handle\tBingo is just inside the entrance to the outpost of Stangard.\n3\tTalk to Langhár and learn what tasks she will handle\tLanghár is just inside the entrance to Stangard.\n4\tInvestigate the commotion to the south-west\tThere has been a loud commotion to the south-west. Is the Easterling attack underway?\n5\tTalk to Sabert in Stangard\tSabert has been stunned into silence by the appearance of Landroval, but you need him ready for battle: the Easterlings have begun their attack on Stangard!\n6\tTalk to Bingo in Stangard\tBingo has returned from his errands, and is ready to participate in the battle... which is now concluded!\n",
[6880]="7004A1C7\n1\tDefend yourself!\tEnemies guard the stairs ahead. You must approach them and prepare to defend yourself!\n2\tConfront Thraknûl\tConfront Thraknûl.\n3\tLet events transpire\tLet events transpire.\n4\tEscape the cell\tEscape the cell using the what information you remember from Akhrûn's own daring escape.\n5\tEscape the cell\tEscape the cell using the what information you remember from Akhrûn's own daring escape.\n6\tEscape the cell\tEscape the cell using the what information you remember from Akhrûn's own daring escape.\n7\tEscape the cell\tEscape the cell using the what information you remember from Akhrûn's own daring escape.\n8\tFree Akhrûn\tAkhrûn can be found in her cell, in the south-western end of Naerband. You should free Akhrûn.\n9\tTalk to Akhrûn\tTalk to Akhrûn.\n10\tFollow Akhrûn and escape Naerband\tFollow Akhrûn and escape Naerband.\n11\tTalk to Akhrûn\tTalk to Akhrûn.\n",
})
